WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Improve your Flutter skills by building a Google Docs clone.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.880
You'll also learn more about Node.js, Express, Sockets, MongoDB, and more.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.120
Rivan Ranawat is your teacher.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:15.520
Rivan has created a bunch of popular tutorials and he is an excellent teacher.

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:19.920
In this tutorial, we are going to build Google Docs clone using Flutter and Node.js.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:24.880
This course is designed for beginners in Node.js and no prior knowledge of JavaScript is required.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.680
We will learn how to authenticate users with Google,

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:32.480
keep the user logged in, create REST APIs to display and create new documents,

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:36.000
build a powerful routing system to share link of our documents,

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.160
and establish socket connection to allow users to collaborate with each other.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:44.720
They can type, color, bold, italicize, change size, and much more simultaneously.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:48.720
Pre-requisite for this course is having a basic knowledge of Flutter.

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:51.200
For state management, we will be using RiverPod.

